namespace gismo
{

/** \defgroup gsDynamicSolvers Dynamic solvers
\ingroup gsStructuralAnalysis

This group collects the time integrators for second-order structural dynamics systems:
\ref gsDynamicExplicitEuler, \ref gsDynamicImplicitEuler, \ref gsDynamicRK4,
\ref gsDynamicNewmark, \ref gsDynamicWilson, \ref gsDynamicBathe and \ref gsDynamicXBraid.
They act on user-defined mass \f$M\f$, damping \f$C\f$, Jacobian and residual
\f$R(\mathbf{u})\f$ operators from \ref gsStructuralAnalysisOps, which is what makes them
element-agnostic.

See \ref nonlinear_shell_dynamic for a worked tutorial.

*/

}
